Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.54,0:00:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,How many quests do you have to complete in total?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.24,0:00:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Three.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.30,0:00:13.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you have to do all these quests?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.38,0:00:15.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Once I complete them, I'll become an Executor.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.89,0:00:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I can be Master's partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.25,0:00:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.22,0:00:20.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What's an Executor?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.85,0:00:21.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like a law enforcer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.18,0:00:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, isn't that dangerous?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.65,0:00:27.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, so you have to complete quests to qualify.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.86,0:00:30.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't the second quest too easy?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.78,0:00:33.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's to let Xiaohei interact with humans,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.20,0:00:35.61,Default,,0,0,0,,and learn to handle all kinds of situations.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.74,0:00:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.83,0:00:41.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Time's up. We can open the third quest now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.17,0:00:46.85,Default,,0,0,0,,What does it say?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.26,0:00:53.01,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Mission 3: By New Year's Eve\NEarn the Praise of the Elfin King Folan"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.75,0:00:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,"Earn the praise of Elfin King Folan. Complete before New Year's Eve."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.14,0:00:54.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh... that's several months away.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.47,0:00:58.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Folan... I've never heard of him...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.80,0:01:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,So the goal is to find this Folan,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.77,0:01:03.43,Default,,0,0,0,,and get him to compliment you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.56,0:01:05.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh... that's a weird quest.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.89,0:01:08.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe you have to help this person with something.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.90,0:01:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Elfin King...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.07,0:01:14.24,Default,,0,0,0,,How many Elfin Kings are there?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.44,0:01:16.15,Default,,0,0,0,,"Elfin King" is a title among elfin.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.28,0:01:17.59,Default,,0,0,0,,The famous ones are:
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.59,0:01:19.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Sun Wukong and Nezha.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.46,0:01:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Mainly because they were written into novels.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.70,0:01:22.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.08,0:01:24.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Nezha is an Elfin King?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.83,0:01:26.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You know Nezha?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.46,0:01:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.25,0:01:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.33,0:01:30.63,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the difference between an Elfin King and an immortal?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.75,0:01:33.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Kings are usually elfin that rule a certain region.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.34,0:01:35.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been a long time since anyone used that title.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.34,0:01:38.09,Default,,0,0,0,,No wonder Master rarely mentioned it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.22,0:01:39.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, Nezha is already recognized as a diety.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.87,0:01:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,So no one really talks about how he used to be an Elfin King.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.91,0:01:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,So maybe Folan isn't a Elfin King anymore now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.77,0:01:49.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we might need to ask around.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.40,0:01:50.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't find anything online either.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.86,0:01:52.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll ask on the elfin forum.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.86,0:01:56.03,Default,,0,0,0,,The deadline is Chinese New Year, so we have plenty of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.49,0:01:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's wait and check the replies tomorrow morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.37,0:02:00.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.00,0:02:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.96,0:02:12.47,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"A Elfin King nowadays?"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.25,0:02:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,No one knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.59,0:02:14.18,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Definitely doesn't exist"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.92,0:02:16.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll leave the post up for now and keep looking.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.76,0:02:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there anyone we could ask directly?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.43,0:02:20.93,Default,,0,0,0,,It's has to be someone really old.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.05,0:02:22.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Then Laojun definitely knows!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.97,0:02:23.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.94,0:02:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's try to find out ourselves first.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.40,0:02:27.67,Default,,0,0,0,,If we really can't, then we'll ask Laojun.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.69,0:02:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,We probably don't want to bother him so casually.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.06,0:02:30.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.83,0:02:32.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so bored.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.27,0:02:34.47,Default,,0,0,0,,All the new shows are so boring.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.83,0:02:36.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish someone would come visit.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.19,0:02:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Di-Ting! Di-Ting! Di-Ting! 
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.60,0:02:40.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it, I'm reading.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.99,0:02:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmph!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.37,0:02:50.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Elfin King Folan?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.46,0:02:52.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, never heard of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.81,0:02:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I've seen a lot in my time,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.42,0:02:59.01,Default,,0,0,0,,but I don't know of anyone by that name, truly.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.88,0:03:02.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Elfin Kings are different from reclusive sages.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.72,0:03:07.85,Default,,0,0,0,,They usually have enough power and influence to earn that title through fame.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.18,0:03:12.94,Default,,0,0,0,,So I'm quite sure there's no such figure within the mainland.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.06,0:03:16.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean he might be a Elfin King from elsewhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.82,0:03:21.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know, but I'm certain he's not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.36,0:03:23.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, thank you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.99,0:03:28.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What'd he say?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.08,0:03:30.83,Default,,0,0,0,,He said definitely not within the mainland.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.21,0:03:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Could this be an overseas mission?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.83,0:03:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Are there elfin are in other countries?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.54,0:03:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Haha, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.17,0:03:40.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It's thought wherever there are living beings, there are elfin.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.38,0:03:43.68,Default,,0,0,0,,So every country has its own myths and legends.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.23,0:03:46.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Do they all hide among humans now?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.17,0:03:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, most of the elfins here follow the rules of the guild.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.89,0:03:53.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What about elsewhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.71,0:03:56.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Currently, this way of coexistance is the norm.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.17,0:03:58.92,Default,,0,0,0,,However, there are some religious states ruled by elfin.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.96,0:04:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,They tend to seek humans to be their proxies.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.65,0:04:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, people usually worship them as prophets.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.69,0:04:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Most other countries play down the influence\Nof elfin and treat them as myths and legends.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.95,0:04:10.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Humans are now focused on technology.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.87,0:04:12.71,Default,,0,0,0,,They walk a different path from Elfin.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.91,0:04:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Which one is better?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.67,0:04:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Neither is one is better than the other.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.54,0:04:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter human or elfin, \Nwe all play a small part in this massive world.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.59,0:04:23.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Each of us with our limits against so many unknowns.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.59,0:04:24.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh. 
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.30,0:04:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,So what now?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.93,0:04:28.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Would asking the Guild count as cheating?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.26,0:04:30.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Would it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.56,0:04:31.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you asking...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.92,0:04:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Shall we go ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.27,0:04:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.03,0:04:36.44,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,{\an8}“Shanxin”
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.52,0:04:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Shanxins calling.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.15,0:04:39.11,Default,,0,0,0,,How's it going? All done?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.23,0:04:41.03,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're done, I'll come over.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.57,0:04:43.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Shanxin,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.15,0:04:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,but we might not be able to hang out for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.91,0:04:48.45,Default,,0,0,0,,We have a really tough mission to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.66,0:04:49.83,Default,,0,0,0,,What mission?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.83,0:04:52.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Can we say?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.46,0:04:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Can we?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.71,0:04:56.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you asking...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.72,0:05:00.15,Default,,0,0,0,,We might go abroad to find an elfin.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.42,0:05:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh? Which country?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.42,0:05:05.05,Default,,0,0,0,,No idea, we don't even know where he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.18,0:05:06.93,Default,,0,0,0,,So we need to do some research first.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.05,0:05:08.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.43,0:05:11.31,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a Elfin King named Folan. Do you know him?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.26,0:05:12.22,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Why would Shanxin know?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.72,0:05:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Folan?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.27,0:05:15.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Is the quest "Earn the praise of Elfin King Folan"?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.98,0:05:17.35,Default,,0,0,0,,How did you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.77,0:05:21.19,Default,,0,0,0,,It's quest from "All Living Creatures"?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.32,0:05:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, they released over a hundred quests this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.57,0:05:26.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone's talking about it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.24,0:05:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Why couldn't I find anything earlier?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.32,0:05:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,This quest was only updated ten minutes ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.78,0:05:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I only just found out too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.74,0:05:34.75,Default,,0,0,0,,And the post has a lot more replies now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.88,0:05:37.42,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Details, please"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.54,0:05:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,So Xiaohei's third quest...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.96,0:05:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,is actually... a game quest?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.00,0:05:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,That simple?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.42,0:05:45.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Simple? You're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.76,0:05:49.64,Default,,0,0,0,,This is an impossible quest to complete!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.93,0:05:50.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.84,0:06:28.05,Default,,0,0,0,,So your last quest is just to play a game?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.34,0:06:29.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.22,0:06:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this quest exactly?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.26,0:06:34.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Today the game released over a hundred quests, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.22,0:06:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,"Earn the praise of Elfin King Folan" was the last one released,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.64,0:06:39.39,Default,,0,0,0,,and it's the hardest one.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.65,0:06:41.86,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Challenge for this quest is\Nlimited to one attempt per person"
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.81,0:06:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,This is practically a whole quest list in itself...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.11,0:06:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Completing this is basically the ultimate achievement in the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.57,0:06:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no limit on how many players can achieve it,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.80,0:06:51.87,Default,,0,0,0,,but given its difficulty, I doubt any player will actually complete it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.32,0:06:55.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like collecting the items might be the simplest?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.12,0:06:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Not necessarily.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.70,0:07:00.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Some players have already gotten exclusive items,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.48,0:07:04.25,Default,,0,0,0,,but according to online compilations, only eleven types have been found so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.38,0:07:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,,There are two types haven't been found yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.21,0:07:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,That means tens of millions of players \Nstill haven't collected all thirteen types of exclusive items.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.09,0:07:14.39,Default,,0,0,0,,But items will only become more common over time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.55,0:07:17.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Early on, some people probably got items and didn't post about them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.02,0:07:21.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet in a few days we'll have detailed info on all exclusive items.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.52,0:07:24.49,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Level 200, non-PK player"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.77,0:07:24.48,Default,,0,0,75,,So far, the first condition looks the hardest.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.27,0:07:27.36,Default,,0,0,0,,But aren't there already players over level 50?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.48,0:07:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,There are already players over level 100 now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.20,0:07:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Because the game is so popular,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.70,0:07:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,there were many high-level players on day one.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.45,0:07:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now, among players above level 60, human characters make up 12%,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.21,0:07:38.67,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Human character 12%"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.70,0:07:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,but all of them have red names.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.62,0:07:42.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Not a single one without a red name.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.71,0:07:45.71,Default,,0,0,0,,The rest are all mystical beasts or animal players.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.63,0:07:45.92,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,{\an8}“Mystical Beast or animal 88%”
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.84,0:07:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Mystical beasts start with stronger stats.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.26,0:07:49.14,Default - Italic,,0,0,430,,{\an8}“Mystical Beast"        “Human”
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.63,0:07:52.63,Default,,0,0,0,,It's estimated their starting stats are roughly equivalent to a human's level 20–30.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.80,0:07:55.97,Default,,0,0,0,,So right now most high-level\Nplayers are mystical beasts,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.97,0:07:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,but everyone guesses human\Nplayers will end up stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.52,0:08:01.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, reaching level 200 is already extremely hard,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.02,0:08:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,and requiring no red name makes it even harder.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.02,0:08:06.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei, which parts don't you get?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.98,0:08:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.14,0:08:10.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What are "stats" or "names"?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.46,0:08:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me explain!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.24,0:08:13.95,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,{\an8}“Explaining”
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.08,0:08:15.37,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,{\an8}“Complete”
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.49,0:08:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.66,0:08:17.91,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,{\an8}“Comprehension”
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.83,0:08:17.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I get it now!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.24,0:08:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,In a normal game, you could\Njust grind to a high level casually.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.46,0:08:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,However, in this game, \Nif you die once, your character is gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.63,0:08:29.13,Default,,0,0,0,,For weaker players, they might stay level 1 forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.25,0:08:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,The hard part is staying alive the whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.88,0:08:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Xiaohei?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.01,0:08:39.85,Default,,0,0,90,,These quests... might be what an Executor has to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.31,0:08:43.48,Default,,0,0,0,,So this is Wuxian's test for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.60,0:08:45.51,Default,,0,0,0,,But this quest can only be accepted once.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.54,0:08:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,If you die, you can't take it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.52,0:08:50.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, if you die, the quest fails.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.86,0:08:54.65,Default,,0,0,0,,We keep dying so quickly. Isn't this a bit too harsh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.78,0:08:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember the transformation we saw yesterday?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.53,0:09:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That was a level 60 skill called "Shapeshift".
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.74,0:09:02.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It allows beasts to take human form.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.66,0:09:05.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Human players can choose a shapeshift path too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.46,0:09:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,So we were probably killed by a level 60 player yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.63,0:09:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei even fought back a bit, and we were only level 1 then.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.42,0:09:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,So we're probably stronger than we think.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.05,0:09:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We could try leveling up first,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.47,0:09:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,,get a feel for things, then come back to level 1 and take the quest.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.76,0:09:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to take it directly.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.85,0:09:25.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that we know the quest, we can't approach it with a "try it out" mindset.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.39,0:09:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't die. We have to complete this in this one life.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.61,0:09:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Holding onto the thought of "there's always next time" is wrong to begin with.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.40,0:09:35.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.07,0:09:39.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Basically, we can die, but Xiaohei can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.16,0:09:42.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm... that doesn't feel quite right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.70,0:09:43.87,Default,,0,0,0,,No one can die.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.91,0:09:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's make it our goal that no one dies.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.58,0:09:50.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Since we're only doing one attempt,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.42,0:09:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,let's try to minmax in character creation.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.13,0:09:56.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Our limited edition already gives us an advantage.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.38,0:09:58.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Every step from now on has to be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.64,0:10:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei is the strongest among us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.34,0:10:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll rely on you for combat.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.81,0:10:04.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll protect everyone for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.93,0:10:07.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave the fighting and physical stuff to me and Xiaohei.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.58,0:10:09.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, then I'll be the tactician. 
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.02,0:10:11.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll be the...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.40,0:10:12.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Newbie!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.82,0:10:16.33,Default,,0,0,0,,In-game spiritual power\Nworks the same as in real life.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.35,0:10:17.49,Default,,0,0,0,,There are six main types.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.61,0:10:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides spiritual power, it also tests physical fitness and reflexes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.91,0:10:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.87,0:10:22.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Take Shanxin, for example.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.92,0:10:24.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Your judgment and reaction speed are great.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.99,0:10:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You've probably played a lot of games and have some combat sense,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.66,0:10:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,but your physical movements can't keep up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.37,0:10:31.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You could try Creation-type Puppeteer.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.42,0:10:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You might be better at controlling something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.96,0:10:34.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there a healing oriented path?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.71,0:10:37.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Life-type, mainly support.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.80,0:10:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'll think about it. We can decide in-game.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.22,0:10:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaobai, keep it simple and pick something from Spirit-type.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.52,0:10:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.31,0:10:47.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei and I will pick what we're best at.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.02,0:10:50.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Haha, this time it's for real!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.06,0:10:55.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Out of these four quests, we probably can't do the second one yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.07,0:10:58.41,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,{\an8}1: Level up without becoming PK
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.07,0:10:58.41,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,{\an8}2: Defeat PK players
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.40,0:10:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's deal with it later.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.90,0:10:58.57,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll prioritize the first quest.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.70,0:11:02.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Quests three and four can be done while leveling up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.78,0:11:02.33,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,{\an8}3: Dungeon quests
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.78,0:11:02.33,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,{\an8}4: Collect limited items
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.74,0:11:04.95,Default,,0,0,0,,The key is the failure conditions for these quests.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.08,0:11:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Death means failure, that goes without saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.87,0:11:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides that, quests two, three, and four have no other failure factors.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.04,0:11:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We just need to complete them slowly.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.88,0:11:16.84,Default,,0,0,0,,The main issue is quest one, it requires no red name.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.30,0:11:20.51,Default,,0,0,0,,So as soon as we get a red name, the quest fails.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.63,0:11:21.93,Default,,0,0,0,,That's really dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.18,0:11:24.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Because human characters start with regional faction affiliations.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.01,0:11:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,,For realism, you can't see which faction anyone belongs to.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.77,0:11:32.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if you go to another faction's territory, you might run into players of the same faction.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.40,0:11:34.19,Default,,0,0,0,,which is why so many players have red names.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.44,0:11:35.69,Default,,0,0,0,,So what do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.82,0:11:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,There's one way to be safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.69,0:11:39.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Form our own faction.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.40,0:11:40.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.24,0:11:42.07,Default,,0,0,0,,We form a faction ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.24,0:11:43.58,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,{\an8}“Shangxin Faction”
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.20,0:11:44.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Then everyone else becomes our enemy faction.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.70,0:11:44.95,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,{\an8}“Everyone is an enemy”
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.07,0:11:47.79,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as we don't kill each other, we won't get red names.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.91,0:11:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It's that simple?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.29,0:11:52.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Not simple, there are requirements to form a faction.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.42,0:11:55.17,Default,,0,0,0,,First, you need at least three members.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.29,0:11:57.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You also need to own some territory. 
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.51,0:11:57.93,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,{\an8}“Faction Established”
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.80,0:12:00.63,Default,,0,0,0,,If you lose the territory, the faction disbands.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.22,0:12:00.80,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,{\an8}“Dissolved”
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.92,0:12:03.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Seizing territory happens to be one of the dungeon quests.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.59,0:12:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It's already on our to-do list.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.76,0:12:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,How exactly do we seize it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.43,0:12:09.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Defeat the lord! Then you replace them!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.72,0:12:12.69,Default,,0,0,0,,But the opponent gets a 4x stat buff in their own territory.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.81,0:12:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.85,0:12:16.15,Default,,0,0,0,,People online have already pieced together some world maps.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.27,0:12:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,These colors are player territories.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.48,0:12:20.86,Default,,0,0,0,,The green areas are unclaimed wild lands.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.99,0:12:24.03,Default,,0,0,0,,To claim an area, you have to defeat that area's boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.16,0:12:26.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, we know boss monsters are also players.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.63,0:12:28.89,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's just like taking human player's territory.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.12,0:12:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,However, bosses get large buffs.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.21,0:12:34.09,Default,,0,0,0,,So, players usually need a large party to take one down.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.83,0:12:38.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Bosses are too unknown for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.25,0:12:40.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I hear some have super strong abilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.17,0:12:42.13,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be safer to seize someone else's territory first.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.26,0:12:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,If we can pick a target, \NI'm actually pretty good at assassination.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.80,0:12:46.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.68,0:12:47.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Great!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.51,0:12:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's begin!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.01,0:12:51.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Shanxin, you have to lie down to play.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.29,0:13:16.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, this episode is so boring.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.64,0:13:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, this time it's a desert.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.86,0:13:35.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.89,0:13:37.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Your hair turned black!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.40,0:13:39.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I found out you can change the color.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.81,0:13:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.94,0:13:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,So cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.11,0:13:48.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, we're in a party now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.66,0:13:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's accept the quest together.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.83,0:13:53.71,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,{\an8}“Quest”
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.41,0:13:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,OK, now the quest progress will track automatically.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.50,0:14:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now our quests are to level up and seize territory,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.54,0:14:02.05,Default,,0,0,0,,but we must avoid getting red names.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.59,0:14:05.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Until we establish our faction, don't attack human players.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.34,0:14:08.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's level up safely on non-human creatures first.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.38,0:14:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.85,0:14:13.18,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a lizard.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.43,0:14:14.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Does killing it give XP?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.60,0:14:21.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't underestimate anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.31,0:14:22.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, right, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.07,0:14:23.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.94,0:14:24.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.53,0:14:27.99,Default,,0,0,0,,This area suddenly became private territory.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.32,0:14:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,So... someone defeated the area boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.41,0:14:33.79,Default - Italic,,550,0,0,,{\an8}“Became a Lord”
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.20,0:14:33.87,Default,,250,0,0,,Done.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.91,0:14:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh! We can see the players in this territory now!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.96,0:14:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright! Let's split up and take them all out!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.13,0:14:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.17,0:14:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.96,0:14:45.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's take on these ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.46,0:14:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Four people.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.46,0:14:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, works for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.09,0:14:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's test the territory buff!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.51,0:14:52.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Charge!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.43,0:14:56.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Why doesn't this game have some kind of vehicle?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.64,0:14:59.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Probably later.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.52,0:15:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,How's it going?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.73,0:15:06.82,Default,,0,0,0,,About two more kilometers and we should be out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.19,0:15:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Running in this game doesn't even tire you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.99,0:15:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.12,0:15:16.49,Default,,0,0,0,,They're all level 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.62,0:15:18.25,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't even test the buff on them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.70,0:15:20.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let's finish them fast and find the next group.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.13,0:15:24.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei, can you take them?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.42,0:15:25.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't we not supposed to "kill" people?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.92,0:15:29.22,Default,,0,0,0,,They're a new faction, so they won't cause red names. Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.34,0:15:31.97,Default,,0,0,0,,"Killing" someone in-game doesn't mean they really "die," right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.09,0:15:34.72,Default,,0,0,0,,They're just avatars. Their real selves are fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.85,0:15:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We've died plenty of times ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.81,0:15:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.98,0:15:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn! What's going on!?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.73,0:15:49.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow! Xiaohei, you're amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.99,0:15:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, we leveled up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.32,0:15:55.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Level 11 already!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.20,0:15:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,That means those two were at least level 28 or higher.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.92,0:16:02.67,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,{\an8}“Skill Unlocked: Level Eye”
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.25,0:16:02.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh! The Level Eye unlocked!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.79,0:16:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Blink once.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.00,0:16:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I can see levels above their heads!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.42,0:16:08.75,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all level 11 now!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.88,0:16:10.01,Default,,0,0,0,,This went so smoothly.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.51,0:16:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't expect Xiaohei to be this much stronger than Gen.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.47,0:16:16.55,Default,,0,0,0,,My physical skills are poor, and my control over spirit power is weak too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.68,0:16:19.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei, how many of those guys do you think you could handle?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.02,0:16:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as they don't use moves I've never seen, probably any number.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.60,0:16:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.02,0:16:27.44,Default,,0,0,0,,That was level 1 against level 28, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.57,0:16:30.36,Default,,0,0,0,,And you level up in the process, doesn't that make you invincible?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.49,0:16:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Feels like the mission isn't that hard anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.03,0:16:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Ignoring level differences and killing with a vital hit,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.19,0:16:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,that kind of mechanic works in Xiaohei's favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.37,0:16:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,But there are plenty of abilities that are hard to guard against.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.87,0:16:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,They were clearly careless just now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.66,0:16:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,We still need to be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.21,0:16:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's spend our skill points.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.63,0:16:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.84,0:16:51.17,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Space-type.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.30,0:16:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What else did Xiaohei use?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.01,0:16:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.38,0:16:56.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's start with Metal in the Spirit-type.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.68,0:16:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Then pick this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.76,0:17:01.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Like this, and this, and this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.39,0:17:03.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Xiaohei is so smart!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.68,0:17:05.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't even read, I can't be that smart...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.02,0:17:07.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll teach you to read!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.77,0:17:08.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.65,0:17:10.53,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm afraid I won't learn...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.65,0:17:12.11,Default,,0,0,0,,How could that be?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.86,0:17:15.03,Default,,0,0,0,,What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.32,0:17:16.07,Default,,0,0,0,,What do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.20,0:17:17.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.41,0:17:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What? They got taken down?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.08,0:17:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.58,0:17:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Not good... So many people...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.96,0:17:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if Xiaohei can handle them, we might die.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.79,0:17:30.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei! Look behind you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.13,0:17:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Those four at the back\Nhave the highest levels.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.93,0:17:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The lord must be among them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.55,0:17:35.85,Default,,0,0,0,,If you can take them out,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.88,0:17:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,we'll jump to about level\N20 and get the territory buff.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.22,0:17:39.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.56,0:17:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel stronger than before.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.18,0:17:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll back you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.22,0:17:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.99,0:18:00.20,Default,,0,425,0,,Great! The buff is ours!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.95,0:18:02.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Now they're the invaders.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.17,0:18:17.63,Default,,0,0,0,,We're level 25 now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.76,0:18:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.59,0:18:21.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like we've got a pretty big advantage early on.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.72,0:18:25.39,Default,,0,0,0,,They have spiritual power but don't know how to use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.60,0:18:28.81,Default,,0,0,0,,With this kind of gameplay, even skilled players like me are thrown off.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.14,0:18:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,But it won't be long before people get used to the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.53,0:18:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure this is a human?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.07,0:18:42.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we've had them confirm it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.28,0:18:46.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Interesting. This game is pretty fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.25,0:18:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Are we really going to kill him?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.62,0:18:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.71,0:18:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, Xiaobai, what skill did you pick?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.09,0:18:57.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.88,0:18:59.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh? Didn't expect that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.73,0:19:00.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire's hard to control.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.97,0:19:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Why that one?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.22,0:19:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Because...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.93,0:19:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It's cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.22,0:19:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,,But why can't I even get a spark at level 25...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.19,0:19:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,And there's no tutorial either.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.73,0:19:14.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a matter of spiritual power control.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.77,0:19:16.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though it's easier to learn in here,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.03,0:19:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,let me teach you how to use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.20,0:19:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,How about you, Gen?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.00,0:19:23.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that you're level 25, how does it feel?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.20,0:19:26.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.08,0:19:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel like we're invincible...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.25,0:19:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now we have territory.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.17,0:19:35.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Most players will grind in their own territory,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.42,0:19:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,but we're planning on leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.51,0:19:40.13,Default,,0,0,0,,To counter players who form a faction and then leave,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.63,0:19:44.05,Default,,0,0,0,,others entering your territory can accept a "defeat the lord" quest,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.18,0:19:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,which gives them the lord's coordinates.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.52,0:19:48.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll be the lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.10,0:19:50.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei shouldn't be lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.77,0:19:51.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It'd reveal his location.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.31,0:19:55.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Only humans can accept that kind of quest.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.40,0:19:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,So any human approaching us from now on are suspicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.07,0:20:00.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.66,0:20:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Are there really tens of millions playing this game?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.45,0:20:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It feels like there aren't many players here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.75,0:20:12.37,Default,,0,0,0,,When we spawned in the main city last time, it was packed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.50,0:20:14.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Players are probably distributed by region type.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.36,0:20:18.21,Default,,0,0,0,,The only information this game carries over after death is map unlocking.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.24,0:20:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,The map of your starting location unlocks automatically.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.76,0:20:23.01,Default,,0,0,0,,And each respawn is at a different location.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.13,0:20:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,But look at our map unlock rate now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.27,0:20:27.48,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,{\an8}“Map Unlock Rate”
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.43,0:20:27.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.68,0:20:29.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though this is a game for elfin,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.39,0:20:31.27,Default,,0,0,0,,how is it actually implemented?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.56,0:20:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It's probably inside someone's spirit space.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.69,0:20:34.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.65,0:20:35.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.48,0:20:38.69,Default,,0,0,0,,This body is a copy, but it's also real.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.82,0:20:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.28,0:20:42.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.75,0:20:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Are all of these players?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.71,0:20:56.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't they fight each other?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.75,0:20:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe wolves can't kill their own kind by design.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.67,0:21:01.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Who said there were no players earlier?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.17,0:21:02.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Now's not the time for that...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.97,0:21:07.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Awooo!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.97,0:21:08.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.89,0:21:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,No way we can take that many, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.81,0:21:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Run?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.72,0:21:13.48,Default,,0,0,0,,No way we outrun four legs, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.60,0:21:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Then what do we do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.90,0:21:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei, you run!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.23,0:21:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't give up so easily!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.17,0:21:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,How interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.84,0:21:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,This game has only been out for three days.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.84,0:21:49.01,Default,,0,0,0,,How many players like that do you think will appear?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.97,0:21:51.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm looking forward to finding out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.27,0:22:02.65,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Stay with me aruite yukou ishikoro wo kette
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.65,0:22:07.39,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Yukisaki wa kitto kimagure demo 
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.39,0:22:12.09,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Hana no kaori wo ryoute ni
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.09,0:22:18.29,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,kore kara deau kimi e to
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.29,0:22:24.44,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Wait for me hanashi wo shiyou kata wo narabete
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.44,0:22:29.24,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Hajimemashite wa gikochinaku temo
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.24,0:22:33.92,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Mochiyotta hako aketara
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.92,0:22:40.44,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Tsumekon da yume wo wakeaou
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.44,0:22:51.76,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Mata ashita tte atarimae ni kawaseru hibi ga
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.76,0:22:57.18,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Itoshikute hakanasugite
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.18,0:23:02.22,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Omoi wa kitto kienai
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.22,0:23:13.45,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Sora wo nagareru kumo ni wa oitsukenai kedo
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.45,0:23:19.00,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Ame ni natte hana wo tsukete kitto boku wo yonderu
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.00,0:23:25.84,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Kitto boku wo yonderu
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.27,0:22:02.65,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,Stay with me - let's walk on, kicking pebbles as we go
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.65,0:22:07.39,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,Our destination may be whimsical
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.39,0:22:12.09,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,But with the scent of flowers in both hands
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.09,0:22:18.29,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,I’ll carry it to the you I’ve yet to meet
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.29,0:22:24.44,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,Wait for me — let’s talk, side by side
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.44,0:22:29.24,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,Even if our first “hello” is a little awkward
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.24,0:22:33.92,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,When we open the boxes we’ve brought
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.92,0:22:40.44,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,Let’s share the dreams we’ve packed inside
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.44,0:22:51.76,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,The days when we can casually say “See you tomorrow”
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.76,0:22:57.18,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,Are so precious and so fleeting
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.18,0:23:02.22,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,Those feelings will never fade away
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.22,0:23:13.45,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,We can’t catch up to the clouds drifting across the sky
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.45,0:23:19.00,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,But they’ll turn to rain, bloom into flowers
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.00,0:23:25.84,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,And surely, they’re calling out to me
